{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-93","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与中项无理线段与比例","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a third apotome, the side of the area is a second apotome of a medial straight line.","book":10,"number":93,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":93,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","contentId":"euclid-10-93","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ad7fed0de7bc90198eb52d6e38154c5b04886e4d416be5c071c909b887061e2","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-93.statement","euclid-10-93.construction.1","euclid-10-93.construction.2","euclid-10-93.proof.1","euclid-10-93.construction.3","euclid-10-93.construction.4","euclid-10-93.proof.2","euclid-10-93.proof.3","euclid-10-93.proof.4","euclid-10-93.proof.5","euclid-10-93.proof.6","euclid-10-93.proof.7","euclid-10-93.proof.8","euclid-10-93.proof.9","euclid-10-93.proof.10","euclid-10-93.proof.11","euclid-10-93.construction.5","euclid-10-93.proof.12","euclid-10-93.proof.13","euclid-10-93.proof.14","euclid-10-93.proof.15","euclid-10-93.proof.16","euclid-10-93.proof.17","euclid-10-93.proof.18","euclid-10-93.proof.19","euclid-10-93.proof.20","euclid-10-93.proof.21","euclid-10-93.proof.22","euclid-10-93.proof.23","euclid-10-93.conclusion","euclid-10-93.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-93.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d410f3817fb2df31796573aef667a78541e76e05d9a754836327952228811bf5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a third apotome, the side of the area is a second apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个区域由有理线段和第三个截差无理线段组成,则该区域的另一边为中项无理线段的第二个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0adb44f56411748cc9e50212395b25a4c41d300d0ba50ee3f31161b58f0cc460","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the area AB be contained by the rational straight line AC and the third apotome AD; I say that the side of the area AB is a second apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们把AB区分为有理线段 AC和3 截差无理线段 AD;我说,AB区是中项无理线段区第二截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f587c7ea6c8597941b789e9252bb89550148488c71402ebd8d0b7b0a930aae71","citations":["euclid-10-def-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let DG be the annex to AD; therefore AG, GD are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, and neither of the straight lines AG, GD is commensurable in length with the rational straight line AC set out, while the square on the whole AG is greater than the square on the annex DG by the square on a straight line commensurable with AG. [[X. Deff. III. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG是AD的附件;因此,AG,GD是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,AG直线中无一是长度可公度,GD直线中无一是长度可公度,有理线段 AC全部是AG,而正方形则比附件DG正方形大,正方形直线上为可公度,AG直线上为AG。 [[X. Deff. III. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"172701068975bfe70d516e57edb8d58e132ff34d4a45cb4b6fb3a8109f996d5a","citations":["euclid-10-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the square on AG is greater than the square on GD by the square on a straight line commensurable with AG, therefore, if there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on DG and deficient by a square figure, it will divide it into commensurable parts. [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果对AG和平行四边形的直线适用等于正方形和DG的第四部分,且有正方形的缺陷,则该部分将分为可公度部分。（相关点与线段：GD） [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d325409adc091708620c0f0fce2205abcba6b22fbd07f7bd0cba46d0d0488c42","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then DG be bisected at E, let there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the square on EG and deficient by a square figure, and let it be the rectangle AF, FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG分,E分两部分AG a 平行四边形 等于 正方形 EG 等于 正方形 等于 正方形 等于 EG 等于 低于 正方形 等于 正方形 等于 等于 等于 正方形 等于 等于 正方形 等于 等于 等于 正方形 等于 等于 等于 EG 等于 等于 EG 等于 等于 等于 正方形 等于 等于 等于 等于 等于 正方形 等于 等于 等于 等于 等于 EG 等于 等于 等于 等于 EG 等于 等于 等于 等于 AG 等于 等于 正方形 等于 等于 等于 等于 等于 AG 等于 等于 等于 等于 等于 等于 AG 等于 等于 等于 等于 等于 AG 等于让它成为矩形、AF,FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3495d710cf5b4d9c041d2c9784eb899c0d22f7f5a59a892b7766b1cc16a8a550","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let EH, FI, GK be drawn through the points E, F, G parallel to AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EH,FI,GK 可以通过E,F,G与AC平行的点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e1cdc44a1e150f6b4e7b99b55fe9dfe82052c102fa7a9a606180ee8c07ed59c","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AF, FG are commensurable; therefore AI is also commensurable with FK. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AF,FG是可公度;因此,AI也是可公度,FK。 [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3bd684c9f3f27f4bfa849122f35caf8c6edae5d13a092f238260542707b2e242","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AF, FG are commensurable in length, therefore AG is also commensurable in length with each of the straight lines AF, FG. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AF,FG是长度可公度,AG也是长度可公度, 每一条直线是AF,FG。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7b08179567ad1ce72a93bbbb9dc896d1d733e4ef41d82f727e6b50d6ee6464bd","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AG is rational and incommensurable in length with AC; so that AF, FG are so also. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AG是有理,不可公度是AC;AF,FG也是这样。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"082821de11abd50054882b54529db9d4d816098048d5a8d52a19609c251f58a0","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the rectangles AI, FK is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,矩形 AI,FK 中每一个是中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7e8dc18760227bf992e65817f8b078c841d034cfe5206176b0be079ce431ce28","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since DE is commensurable in length with EG, therefore DG is also commensurable in length with each of the straight lines DE, EG. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于DE是长度可公度,EG,因此DG也是长度可公度,每条直线DE,EG。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e9e18752e14e50c084d5db9bc88663eed1f2791d0bf90eb6c10b2a6997fddc47","citations":["euclid-10-13","euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But GD is rational and incommensurable in length with AC; therefore each of the straight lines DE, EG is also rational and incommensurable in length with AC; [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] therefore each of the rectangles DH, EK is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GD线长为有理,不可公度长为AC;因此,DE直线的每条长为DE,EG长为有理,不可公度长为AC;因此,矩形直线的每条长为中项无理线段,EK长为中项无理线段。（相关点与线段：DH） [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"719b4c43a6c011abcfa9918b8c6f6a29260afc851a6a0244b44eed8f036abc87","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AG, GD are commensurable in square only, therefore AG is incommensurable in length with GD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG,GD是平方可公度而长度不可公度 所以AG是不可公度,GD是GD"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ca83eac67c5148369e1837ea8415c341719e334316298a37cb7f23954a092ef","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AG is commensurable in length with AF, and DG with EG; therefore AF is incommensurable in length with EG. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AG是长度可公度和AF、DG和EG;因此,AF是不可公度长EG。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6c4bceceee2b9429f360b7589d7ea1ebd6d8f87f986813832011bdfaeb6039bb","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AF is to EG, so is AI to EK; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore AI is incommensurable with EK. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AF对EG的比等于AI对EK的比;因此,AI对EK的比是不可公度对EK；AF 与 EG 之比等于 AI 与 EK 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b127ae26eea4f263ff1477b0ad49de0004cc28bded3980813e5c87a88f571ef","citations":["euclid-6-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let the square LM be constructed equal to AI, and let there be subtracted NO equal to FK and being about the same angle with LM; therefore LM, NO are about the same diameter. [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,正方形 LM的构造等于AI,NO等于FK,角度与LM大致相同;因此,LM,NO直径大致相同。 [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":16,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72802f1b081a1ac963339b24e8028c256c6eb4278fd7cbc008025d669220eb2f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let PR be their diameter, and let the figure be drawn."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让PR是直径, 让图绘制。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f5fa8ae93da9d5f32aa19bbb614f4b2e27f93e2f904791f1ff0db3d8050e937","citations":["euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the rectangle AF, FG is equal to the square on EG, therefore, as AF is to EG, so is EG to FG. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于矩形 AF,FG等于EG的正方形,AF-EG的比等于EG-FG的比；AF 与 EG 之比等于 EG 与 FG 之比。 [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3836be0a4769108f026f0ea075030117f02cc584d937434c4182b2c9c496ec63","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AF is to EG, so is AI to EK, and, as EG is to FG, so is EK to FK; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore also, as AI is to EK, so is EK to FK; [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] therefore EK is a mean proportional between AI, FK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AF对EG的比等于AI对EK的比,EG对FG的比等于EK对FK的比;因此,AI对EK的比等于EK对FK的比,因此,EK对FK的比等于EK对FK的比,EK对AF的比是AI对FK的比比例中项；AF 与 EG 之比等于 AI 与 EK 之比；EG 与 FG 之比等于 EK 与 FK 之比；AI 与 EK 之比等于 EK 与 FK 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c0e0f9f7c229e1c10dae199e84df5b348ce94ce1dbab6cce5f32d5559e3eee2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But MN is also a mean proportional between the squares LM, NO, and AI is equal to LM, and FK to NO; therefore EK is also equal to MN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但MN也是正方形,LM,NO,AI等于LM,FK等于NO,EK等于MN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b0a76d6c1ac2e6798f43e696fcba62488adf0cc46fad74645199732bae1a60b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But MN is equal to LO, and EK equal to DH; therefore the whole DK is also equal to the gnomon UVW and NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但MN等于LO,EK等于DH;因此,整个DK也等于曲尺形 UVW和NO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"161a5a55ccbc537e130e785bb892de66d1247a47536568874e352de1927a571a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AK is also equal to LM, NO; therefore the remainder AB is equal to ST, that is, to the square on LN; therefore LN is the side of the area AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AK也等于LM,NO;因此,其余AB等于ST,即LN中的正方形;因此,LN是AB地区的一方。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f94a6d8ac8a2fff950d9f6e56694474cf3cf027a33ba1d36ea2128e103b6908c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that LN is a second apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说LN是中项无理线段秒中的第二截差无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f220db1d0ff8e0e347259c53a147791f3f16fe1ee30607be3dcbb40818221d16","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AI, FK were proved medial, and are equal to the squares on LP, PN, therefore each of the squares on LP, PN is also medial; therefore each of the straight lines LP, PN is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AI,FK证明为中项无理线段,相当于LP,PN正方形,因此,正方形LP,PN中,每个也为中项无理线段;因此,LP,PN直线中,每个直线为中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e186c4640e3e934105ef6afe9f78e7150eaddafc71b94d1bafe55f557cf082c","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AI is commensurable with FK, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] therefore the square on LP is also commensurable with the square on PN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AI是可公度,FK,LP,正方形也是可公度,PN。 [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dcf79942a7ed5299e4eded494993984bb718844d60c52ed379ecb5f67113ec72","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since AI was proved incommensurable with EK, therefore LM is also incommensurable with MN, that is, the square on LP with the rectangle LP, PN; so that LP is also incommensurable in length with PN; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] therefore LP, PN are medial straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自AI证明为不可公度EK,因此,LM也是不可公度MN,即LP正方形LP矩形LPPN;因此,LP也是不可公度PNPN7月7日LPPNLM中项无理线段3月AI日。 [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"decff5cd21519529edba0a056e6e08f276fdab7545768746d11aba9e66d9f3dc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that they also contain a medial rectangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,它们也含有中项无理线段 矩形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"910c2ef41b393a634f80f58af733a0a8caff7dcb1cb43680c64965ae1065063f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since EK was proved medial, and is equal to the rectangle LP, PN, therefore the rectangle LP, PN is also medial, so that LP, PN are medial straight lines commensurable in square only which contain a medial rectangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为EK证明为中项无理线段,等于矩形 LP,因此矩形 LP为中项无理线段 PN,PN为中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,包含中项无理线段 矩形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1255c401f0c1fb385809bd238ac89fd955ff7ecfb1c469dba3986daff5897624","citations":["euclid-10-75"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore LN is a second apotome of a medial straight line; [[X. 75](/principles/euclid-10-75)] and it is the side of the area AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,LN是中项无理线段区中第二截差无理线段个;它是AB区一侧。 [[X. 75](/principles/euclid-10-75)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":29,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a9766bbe9037920469d602edd64fc17e2dc82970abde319baba20dcbd4d4c0b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side of the area AB is a second apotome of a medial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB区一侧是中项无理线段.Q.E区中的第二截差无理线段区。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-93.source","contentId":"euclid-10-93","revisionId":"euclid-10-93@raw-8ad7fed0de7bc901","order":30,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7c68303e9a430b07c3d36b876ae5039e881e3e2544826a2726f2c0a534b5ae87","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-93:euclid-10-def-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-93","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-93.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93/","sourceLabel":"X. Deff. III. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-93:euclid-10-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-93","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-93.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93/","sourceLabel":"X. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-93:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-93","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-93.proof.2","euclid-10-93.proof.10","euclid-10-93.proof.13","euclid-10-93.proof.19","euclid-10-93.proof.20"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-93:euclid-10-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-93","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-93.proof.2","euclid-10-93.proof.10","euclid-10-93.proof.19","euclid-10-93.proof.20"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93/","sourceLabel":"X. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-93:euclid-10-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-93","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-93.proof.3","euclid-10-93.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93/","sourceLabel":"X. 15"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-93:euclid-10-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-93","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-93.proof.4","euclid-10-93.proof.7","euclid-10-93.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.93/","sourceLabel":"X. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-93:euclid-10-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-93","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-93.proof.5","euclid-10-93.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"